  <section inlist="toc" xml:id="S3">
    <tags>
      <tag>3</tag>
      <tag role="refnum">3</tag>
      <tag role="typerefnum">§3</tag>
    </tags>
    <title><tag close=" ">3</tag>Complexity and Verification</title>
    <para xml:id="S3.p1">
      <p>As demonstrated in Algorithm <ref labelref="LABEL:alg:relaxation"/>, initialization takes place in
lines <ref labelref="LABEL:line:init"/>–<ref labelref="LABEL:line:source"/>. The relaxation loop (line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:for"/>)
iterates over all edges at line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:forall"/>. The triangle inequality is checked
at line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:check"/>, triggering the update at line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:relax"/>.
Direct compound reference: <ref labelref="LABEL:alg:relaxation"/>.<ref labelref="LABEL:line:relax"/>.
The overall running time is <Math mode="inline" tex="\mathcal{O}(|V|\cdot|E|)" text="O * (absolute-value@(V) cdot absolute-value@(E))" xml:id="S3.p1.m1">
          <XMath>
            <XMApp>
              <XMTok meaning="times" role="MULOP">⁢</XMTok>
              <XMTok font="caligraphic" role="UNKNOWN">O</XMTok>
              <XMDual>
                <XMRef idref="S3.p1.m1.3"/>
                <XMWrap>
                  <XMTok role="OPEN" stretchy="false">(</XMTok>
                  <XMApp xml:id="S3.p1.m1.3">
                    <XMTok name="cdot" role="MULOP">⋅</XMTok>
                    <XMDual>
                      <XMApp>
                        <XMTok meaning="absolute-value"/>
                        <XMRef idref="S3.p1.m1.1"/>
                      </XMApp>
                      <XMWrap>
                        <XMTok role="OPEN" stretchy="false">|</XMTok>
                        <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN" xml:id="S3.p1.m1.1">V</XMTok>
                        <XMTok role="CLOSE" stretchy="false">|</XMTok>
                      </XMWrap>
                    </XMDual>
                    <XMDual>
                      <XMApp>
                        <XMTok meaning="absolute-value"/>
                        <XMRef idref="S3.p1.m1.2"/>
                      </XMApp>
                      <XMWrap>
                        <XMTok role="OPEN" stretchy="false">|</XMTok>
                        <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN" xml:id="S3.p1.m1.2">E</XMTok>
                        <XMTok role="CLOSE" stretchy="false">|</XMTok>
                      </XMWrap>
                    </XMDual>
                  </XMApp>
                  <XMTok role="CLOSE" stretchy="false">)</XMTok>
                </XMWrap>
              </XMDual>
            </XMApp>
          </XMath>
        </Math>.</p>
    </para>
